    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Pet Hooligan is a vibrant, satirical, 3rd person shooter-platformer filled with cartoon chaos and destruction with both PvP and PvE experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/fe4df65c119ff9ce187682b44ce50a9d.avif?t=1755101152\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platform across the city to find new vantage points to eliminate your enemies. Skateboard like a pro-skater and build trick combos to boost your traversal speed..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/2049c200e77fbd88f385518326cb5410.avif?t=1755101152\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/824e32e64531653bf16c9f0a097ce076.avif?t=1755101152\" width=616 height=232 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate enemies with an arsenal of comical weapons from flamethrowers to toilet plungers. Destroy the cars, crates, and barrels for extra explodey chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/0da9f20999538fff99a5e8386dfa6544.avif?t=1755101152\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/cd55ddf88debe2f82328a0ff3f10196f.avif?t=1755101152\" width=616 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pledge allegiance to one of seven factions, from the athletic Rogue Jumpers to the bionic Cypherbuns. Raise the ranks and unlock unique perks to aid you in your battle for control over Hooliland City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/f34d9c4b44e79a2212b2ed1c324f7310.avif?t=1755101152\" width=616 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your abilities to the test with both PvP and PvE experiences. Play with friends in a variety of modes including: Sandbox, Free-for-All, and Team Deathmatch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/078f0dde06966ead3a66d23669e060a4.avif?t=1755101152\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/7cd9ee09d0a28fe5e673ffe065b4e01e.avif?t=1755101152\" width=616 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your Hooligan and flex your sick drip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/42b2cb2f705420793d2715d955b2c3b5.avif?t=1755101152\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Pet Hooligan is a vibrant, satirical, 3rd person shooter-platformer filled with cartoon chaos and destruction with both PvP and PvE experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/fe4df65c119ff9ce187682b44ce50a9d.avif?t=1755101152\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platform across the city to find new vantage points to eliminate your enemies. Skateboard like a pro-skater and build trick combos to boost your traversal speed..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/2049c200e77fbd88f385518326cb5410.avif?t=1755101152\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/824e32e64531653bf16c9f0a097ce076.avif?t=1755101152\" width=616 height=232 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate enemies with an arsenal of comical weapons from flamethrowers to toilet plungers. Destroy the cars, crates, and barrels for extra explodey chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/0da9f20999538fff99a5e8386dfa6544.avif?t=1755101152\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/cd55ddf88debe2f82328a0ff3f10196f.avif?t=1755101152\" width=616 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pledge allegiance to one of seven factions, from the athletic Rogue Jumpers to the bionic Cypherbuns. Raise the ranks and unlock unique perks to aid you in your battle for control over Hooliland City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/f34d9c4b44e79a2212b2ed1c324f7310.avif?t=1755101152\" width=616 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your abilities to the test with both PvP and PvE experiences. Play with friends in a variety of modes including: Sandbox, Free-for-All, and Team Deathmatch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/078f0dde06966ead3a66d23669e060a4.avif?t=1755101152\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/7cd9ee09d0a28fe5e673ffe065b4e01e.avif?t=1755101152\" width=616 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your Hooligan and flex your sick drip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/42b2cb2f705420793d2715d955b2c3b5.avif?t=1755101152\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "From former Pixar\u2122 and EA\u2122 devs comes My Pet Hooligan, a fast-paced 3rd-person shooter-platformer! Hop in as a rebellious rabbit, wield comical weapons, skateboard like a pro-skater, unleash chaotic destruction, and fight for control over Hooliland City. Join the rebellion today!",
